# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# This is load-bearing, not cosmetic. check.mjs extracts the app's source by
# slicing index.html on literal markers, one of which is `';\n'` — under CRLF
# the text is `;\r\n`, the marker never matches, and the extraction throws.
# That takes all twelve safety checks down with it, including the ones standing
# between a 3B model and a seven-year-old's ears.
#
# index.html and check.mjs are LF today. Keep them that way on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows shells are happier with CRLF, and these are only ever run on Windows.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.ico binary
*.crt binary
